<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Q3 GDP figure delayed until Friday.</title>
<headline>Swedish Q3 GDP figure delayed until Friday.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's Central Statistics Bureau on Friday said third-quarter gross domestic product data will be delayed, probably until Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;It won't come out today...in all probability, the figure will be released on Friday,&quot; SCB spokesman Olle Nyman told Reuters.</p>
<p>Sweden Q3 GDP data were originally scheduled to be released at 1200 GMT on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
